# expiry1 — EXPIRE and TTL
#
# Learn: EXPIRE key seconds gives a key a time to live; TTL key tells you
# how many seconds are left (-1: no expiry, -2: no such key). PEXPIRE and
# PTTL do the same in milliseconds.
#
# Task: the login session session:9f2c exists (the check creates it) and
# must live for 30 minutes. A colleague wrote the line below. Fix it.
#

# 30 minutes
EXPIRE session:9f2c 30
TTL session:9f2c
